        "original_id": "83d888a9-11c1-58a2-a2b4-b2a941a206ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paul Avery, Patricia Hearst\n- Organizations: Symbionese Liberation Army\n- Roles: American journalist\n- Topics: Zodiac killings, Patricia Hearst kidnapping\n\nFacts:\n- Paul Avery was an American journalist who was born on April 2, 1934, and died on December 10, 2000.\n- Paul Avery was best known for reporting on the serial killer known as the Zodiac.\n- Paul Avery later worked on coverage of the Patricia Hearst kidnapping.\n- Patricia Hearst was abducted by the Symbionese Liberation Army.\n- The Symbionese Liberation Army was a small left-wing terrorist group with about 20 members.",
